{"id":"5d28b1dc93dafdc7","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-leftmost-ce-degree.md","title":"有效闭类的最左路径有 c.e. 度","display":"thm-leftmost-ce-degree — 有效闭类的最左路径有 c.e. 度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-leftmost-ce-degree","aliases":["20-thm-leftmost-ce-degree"],"display":"thm-leftmost-ce-degree — 有效闭类的最左路径有 c.e. 度","chapter":"8","section":"8.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 8.5.1(iii)","source_printed_pages":[169,170],"source_pdf_pages":[202,203],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-extendible]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-leftmost-ce-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-leftmost-ce-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-leftmost-ce-degree — 有效闭类的最左路径有 c.e. 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 8.5.1(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>169</span><span>170</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>202</span><span>203</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 可计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]\\ne\\varnothing\">\\([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是其字典序最小路径；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_X=\\{\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma):\\sigma&lt;_{lex}X\\upharpoonright|\\sigma|\\}\">\\(L_X=\\{\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma):\\sigma&lt;_{lex}X\\upharpoonright|\\sigma|\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8705fb72e379b21a\" href=\"?note=8705fb72e379b21a\" title=\"20-df-extendible\">20-df-extendible</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}leftmost-ce-degree}\\vdash\nL_X\\in\\mathcal E\\quad\\land\\quad L_X\\equiv_T X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}leftmost-ce-degree}\\vdash\nL_X\\in\\mathcal E\\quad\\land\\quad L_X\\equiv_T X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，它严格在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 左边当且仅当长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\le_{lex}\\sigma\">\\(\\tau\\le_{lex}\\sigma\\)</span> 都不可延伸。不可延伸由有限空层见证，有限多个见证可并行等待，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_X\">\\(L_X\\)</span> c.e.。从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 直接作同长比较可判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_X\">\\(L_X\\)</span>；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_X\">\\(L_X\\)</span> 在长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的所有串中找到首个不在左切的串，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\upharpoonright n\">\\(X\\upharpoonright n\\)</span>。非空紧致闭类有最左路径，逐层选具有路径的最左子节点即可证明存在，无须声称这一步普通可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.5.1(iii)；印刷页 169, 170；PDF 第 202, 203 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"8705fb72e379b21a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":""